      {"@type":"Question","name":"Is a green event a better experience?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Less waste and shorter queues, cleaner sites and nature settings generally make for a better day or night out."}},
      {"@type":"Question","name":"How does choosing a sustainable event help the community?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Local vendors, artists and suppliers keep more of the money, strengthening island communities."}},
