      {"@type":"Question","name":"Does choosing a sustainable event actually reduce my impact?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes — a low-impact event cuts the emissions, waste and water tied to your night out, from how you travel to what you drink and eat."}},
